{"ref":"BDB, אֱדוֹם","hw":"אֱדוֹם","html":"<big><span dir=\"rtl\">אֱדוֹם</span></big>  (†<span dir=\"rtl\">אֱדֹם</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 25:14\" href=\"/Ezekiel.25.14\">Ez 25:14</a>) <strong>n.pr.m.</strong><br><strong>1.</strong>  <strong>Edom (</strong>name of a god? v. Sta<sup>G.1, 121</sup> RS<sup>Sem 43</sup>; vid. n.pr. <span dir=\"rtl\">עבדאדם</span>; but Bae<sup>Rel 10</sup> thinks dial. var. of <span dir=\"rtl\">אָדָם</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">בני אדום</span> = <span dir=\"rtl\">בְנֵי אָדָם</span><strong>)</strong> = Esau, elderson of Isaac <a data-ref=\"Genesis 25:30\" href=\"/Genesis.25.30\">Gn 25:30</a> (J) (where etym. = <em>red</em>, cf. v <a data-ref=\"Genesis 25:25\" href=\"/Genesis.25.25\">25</a> (E?) & sub <span dir=\"rtl\">אַדְמוֹנִי</span>) <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:1\" href=\"/Genesis.36.1\">36:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:8\" href=\"/Genesis.36.8\">8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:19\" href=\"/Genesis.36.19\">19</a> (P).<br><strong>2.</strong>  coll. (<strong>m.</strong> but <strong>f.</strong> <a data-ref=\"Malachi 1:4\" href=\"/Malachi.1.4\">Mal 1:4</a>) <em>Edomites, Idumeans</em> as descend. of Esau Gn <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:9\" href=\"/Genesis.36.9\">36:9</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:43\" href=\"/Genesis.36.43\">43</a> (P); also <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 14:47\" href=\"/I_Samuel.14.47\">1 S 14:47</a> + 31 textual + <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 8:13\" href=\"/II_Samuel.8.13\">2 S 8:13</a> (for MT <span dir=\"rtl\">ארם</span>; 𝔊𝔖, v. <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 18:12\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.18.12\">1 Ch 18:12</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 60:2\" href=\"/Psalms.60.2\">ψ 60:2</a>, We Dr); perh. also v <a data-ref=\"Psalms 60:12\" href=\"/Psalms.60.12\">12</a> (𝔊𝔖 <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 18:11\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.18.11\">1 Ch 18:11</a>; MT <span dir=\"rtl\">ארם</span> but v. We Dr); also <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 20:2\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.20.2\">2 Ch 20:2</a> (v. Be); <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳</span> = king of Edom <a data-ref=\"Numbers 20:18\" href=\"/Numbers.20.18\">Nu 20:18</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 20:20\" href=\"/Numbers.20.20\">20</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 20:21\" href=\"/Numbers.20.21\">21</a>; poet. <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּנֵי א׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 137:7\" href=\"/Psalms.137.7\">ψ 137:7</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">בַּת א׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 4:21\" href=\"/Lamentations.4.21\">La 4:21</a>, <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 4:22\" href=\"/Lamentations.4.22\">22</a>. v. now F Buhl<sup>Gesch. Edomiter (1893)</sup>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  <em>land of Edom</em>, <em>Idumaea (</em>f. <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 32:29\" href=\"/Ezekiel.32.29\">Ez 32:29</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 35:15\" href=\"/Ezekiel.35.15\">35:15</a> and <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 36:5\" href=\"/Ezekiel.36.5\">36:5</a>) S. & SE. of Pal. <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:32\" href=\"/Genesis.36.32\">Gn 36:32</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:43\" href=\"/Genesis.36.43\">43</a> + 32 textual (incl. <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׂדֵה א׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 32:4\" href=\"/Genesis.32.4\">Gn 32:4</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶרֶץ א׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:16\" href=\"/Genesis.36.16\">Gn 36:16</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:17\" href=\"/Genesis.36.17\">17</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:21\" href=\"/Genesis.36.21\">21</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:31\" href=\"/Genesis.36.31\">31</a> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 20:23\" href=\"/Numbers.20.23\">Nu 20:23</a> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 21:4\" href=\"/Numbers.21.4\">21:4</a> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 33:37\" href=\"/Numbers.33.37\">33:37</a> +);—uncertain whether <strong>2</strong> or <strong>3</strong> are <a data-ref=\"Exodus 15:15\" href=\"/Exodus.15.15\">Ex 15:15</a> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 20:14\" href=\"/Numbers.20.14\">Nu 20:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 24:18\" href=\"/Numbers.24.18\">24:18</a> + 9 textual (chiefly in <span dir=\"rtl\">מֶלֶךְ א׳</span> etc.)","next":"BDB, אֲדֹמִי","prev":"BDB, אֱדֹם"}